  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water.\n• Place potato fries on a lined oven tray.\n• Sprinkle over Nan's special seasoning, drizzle with olive oil, season with a pinch of salt and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, slice tomato into thin rounds. Roughly chop baby cos lettuce (see ingredients).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6523997b6c96c01e5b470102-1e4adcf9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• With 10 minutes remaining on fries, drain haloumi and pat dry. Slice haloumi horizontally to get 1 piece per person.\n• In a shallow bowl, place the plain flour. In a second shallow bowl, whisk the egg. In a third shallow bowl, place herb crumbing mix.\n• Dip haloumi slices into flour mixture, followed by egg and finally in herb crumbing mix. Set aside on a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6523997b6c96c01e5b470102-b24a5070.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base of the pan over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 2 minutes each side. Set aside on a paper towel-lined plate. TIP: Add extra oil if needed so the haloumi does not stick to the pan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6523997b6c96c01e5b470102-85c5f70b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Halve bake-at-home burger buns and bake directly on a wire oven rack until heated through, 2-3 minutes.\n• In a medium bowl, combine lettuce and mustard cider dressing.\n• Spread each bun base with tartare sauce. Top with crumbed haloumi, tomato slices and a handful of cos lettuce.\n• Serve with spiced fries and remaining tartare sauce. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6523997b6c96c01e5b470102-80cb76f6.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
